Package: uzunyx-shortcuts
Version: @VERSION@
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: emi <285864120+antarest47@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3, systemd, libkf6config-bin, kwin-wayland (>= 4:6.7), plasma-workspace (>= 4:6.7)
Conflicts: waifbian-shortcuts
Replaces: waifbian-shortcuts
Description: Uzunyx global keyboard shortcuts for Plasma
 Adds these global shortcuts at login, next to the existing ones:
 .
  Alt+W / Alt+S         volume up / down
  Alt+2                 maximize window
  Alt+1 / Alt+3         tile window left / right
  Alt+Escape            close window
  Alt+X                 play / pause
  Alt+Z / Alt+C         previous / next track
  Ctrl+Shift+S          rectangular region screenshot (Spectacle)
  Super+Escape          lock screen (taken from the System Monitor)
 .
 They are applied through kglobalaccel once per version of the list, so
 later changes in System Settings are kept.
